# PMP Blog Content Rules

## Site context

This is **noteskeep.com** — a PMP exam practice site built with Astro. Content lives in `src/content/pmp-questions/`.

## Tone and quality

- Professional, educational, exam-realistic
- Situational scenarios that require judgment, not trivia recall
- Explanations should reference PMI thinking (stakeholder engagement, change control, risk response, etc.)

## Format

- Use the canonical post at `src/content/pmp-questions/2026-06-07-regulatory-stakeholder-power-shift.md` as the template
- Options use markdown bullet list with bold labels: `* **A)** ...`
- Never leave `token-handoff` blocks in published content

## Verification

After any content change, run `npm run build` before committing.
